###> brevo / contact form (REST API) ###
# Option A — REST API: create an API key at https://app.brevo.com/settings/keys/api (long key, e.g. xkeysib-...).
# Option B — no API key: leave BREVO_API_KEY empty and set BREVO_SENDER_EMAIL + BREVO_NOTIFY_EMAIL; the form uses MAILER_DSN (Brevo SMTP).
# Sender must be a verified sender/domain in Brevo for either option.
BREVO_API_KEY=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
